 record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. January to February came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years, and April to May in 28. In 2025, August to September ran 39% of normal and September to October 47% on the middle of the grids. Grid 23240 had its driest year in 1988 at 54%, and a preliminary estimate for grid 22640 puts August to September 2026 at 78.9.</p>"}
